  "description": "TRACKLOCROSS\nThere are some who contend that nothing good ever came from taking the easy way out. For evangelists of this claim, we’d like to direct your attention to the SO-EZ, our venerable first generation tracklocross frameset and staple of chaotic bandit-cross races around the world.\nFor you all who are still insisting that the best results come from taking the hard way to glory, we present the VRYHRD. With slight modifications in geometry, premium tubing, and tighter clearances the VRYHRD is a race ready evolution of the stalwart, unshakable SO-EZ\nThe VRYHRD is made in Oakland, CA by Prandus Limited with a double butted tube recipe, custom bent stays and machined bits by Paragon Machine Works in Richmond CA, this bike is just as homegrown as your local race series.",
